#: ../../source/manufacturing/3d_printing/printer_choice/high_end_printers/high_end_printers.rst:149
msgid ""
"Anker's new entry into the 3d printer market, the AnkerMake M5, is a very "
"reasonably priced printer for the features it brings. With print failure "
"detection, speed printing capabilities, and an extremely friendly interface "
"with almost no setup, the M5 is a great option."
msgstr ""
"Ankerの3Dプリンター市場への新たな参入、AnkerMake "
"M5は、その機能に対して非常にリーズナブルな価格のプリンターです。印刷失敗検出機能、スピード印刷能力、ほぼ設定が不要な非常に使いやすいインターフェースを備えたM5は、素晴らしい選択肢です。"

#: ../../source/manufacturing/3d_printing/printer_choice/high_end_printers/high_end_printers.rst:155
